1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,920
You can choose which columns every table shows.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,880
Right click any column header.

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:12,290
Choose Customize.

4
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:18,930
Tick a column to show it, untick to hide it.

5
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,990
Select one and use the arrows to move it.

6
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:25,350
Default puts everything back as it was.

7
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:30,500
Click OK.

8
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:34,860
The table changes straight away, and remembers your choice.

9
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:38,730
Drag the edge of a header to make a column wider or narrower.

